  "origin": "direct human-governor instruction: the Xingcheng special law applies only to the native model Xingcheng, and when other Codex provisions conflict the Xingcheng special law is the controlling principle. Codified into B81 (xingcheng-consolidated-special-law, anchor of CODEX_STAR_PRIVILEGED_INSTITUTION_SPECIAL_LAW) using the established special-law precedent pattern (A59 PRECEDENCE clause) under the A28 more-specific-scope ordering and the D47 duty that every special law declare precedence over materially overlapping law. A18 remains controlling: the whole Codex stays the single highest authority and this precedence never expands granted power.",
  "change_class": "architecture-authority",
  "required_review": "five-sovereign-audit-unanimous-pass",
  "flow": "A382/A488-non-disruptive-amendment-flow",
